# The F/P's third job node: Ifrit goes up in a rage for three seconds and
# strikes every 0.6 of one, six lines over twelve enemies.
#
# 600ms is GMS's `x`, the one number in its common block the readout never
# spends -- the same place Spirit of Snow's cadence was found. What settles it
# is that `t`, the 0.6 seconds each active Fervent Drain adds, is the SAME
# number: a stack buys exactly one more strike, and the window runs 3 to 6
# seconds as five strikes run to ten.
#
# "Active Fervent Drain" is burns alight capped at five, which is the count
# that skill reads for its own credit -- so this is the same board state seen
# from the other side. On a boss the F/P sits at two to four of them most of
# the time: Flame Sweep and Ifrit always, DoT Punisher and Poison Nova only
# through part of their 25-second cycles. The window is really variable here,
# not a cap dressed up as one.
#
# Small against its siblings on purpose -- 26,400% at the top of its range
# against Poison Nova's 66,000%, and GMS wrote it that way. It is filler beside
# the branch's two big buttons, and the numbers are all its own.
#
# Twelve enemies stands: the client gives this skill no hitbox at all, which is
# the case where the stated cap is the reach.
#
# The 480ms cast masonym gives it is not what it costs: a buff is raised from
# a sequence, which paces every one of them at 120ms alike.
#
# GMS's "only when Ifrit is summoned" is the required skill. A summon here is
# permanent once learned, so the condition never binds -- but a book that has
# not paid for Ifrit has not paid for this.
name: "Elemental Fury"
description:
  "Unleash the fury of flame in the form of an enraged spirit. Can only be "
  "used when Ifrit is summoned. Unaffected by attack reflection."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ACTIVE
tags: SKILL_TAG_FIRE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_FIRE_POISON_ARCH_MAGE_V skill_order: 3 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
required_skill {
  skill_name: "Ifrit"
  level: 20
}
base_delay_ms: 120
cooldown_seconds: 60.0
buff {
  duration_seconds: 3.0
  duration_seconds_per_dot: 0.6
  dot_count_cap: 5
  pulse {
    label: "Enraged Ifrit"
    cast_interval_seconds: 0.6
    lines: 6
    max_enemies: 12
    base { skill_pct: 2.08 }
    per_level { skill_pct: 0.08 }
  }
}
